---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import heroImage from "../../assets/experiences/balaton-shore.jpg";
import supportImage from "../../assets/experiences/tanuhegyek-drone-dji-20260512.jpg";
import { toAbsoluteUrl } from "../../data/site-seo";

const structuredData = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    itemListElement: [
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: toAbsoluteUrl("/en/") },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "Experiences", item: toAbsoluteUrl("/en/experiences/") },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 3, name: "Lake Balaton", item: toAbsoluteUrl("/en/lake-balaton/") }
    ]
  }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Lake Balaton Beaches | Dandelion Guesthouses"
  description="Explore nearby Lake Balaton beaches, Badacsony, Szigliget and easy summer water programs from the Dandelion guesthouses."
  canonicalPath="/en/lake-balaton/"
  lang="en"
  ogLocale="en_US"
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
  <section class="balaton-page">
    <div class="dnd-container balaton-page__inner">
      <section class="balaton-page__hero">
        <div class="balaton-page__hero-copy">
          <span class="balaton-page__eyebrow">Easy lake days</span>
          <h1>Lake Balaton beaches and waterside programs</h1>
          <p>
            When you want a day by the water, Lake Balaton is an easy part of a Dandelion stay:
            beaches, piers, summer walks, sunset dinners and light water programs can all fit into
            a calm countryside holiday.
          </p>
          <p>
            A morning at the beach, a wine stop on the hill in the afternoon and an evening walk in
            Badacsony or Szigliget can belong to the same day. That is the charm of this area: you
            do not have to choose between the lake and the Balaton Uplands.
          </p>
          <ul class="balaton-page__hero-highlights">
            <li>nearby beaches by car</li>
            <li>Badacsony, Szigliget and Ábrahámhegy as easy lake directions</li>
            <li>kayak, canoe and SUP options in season</li>
            <li>simple programs for families, couples and summer evenings</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="balaton-page__hero-actions">
            <a href="/en/szallasok/" class="balaton-page__cta-primary">View accommodations</a>
            <a href="/en/experiences/" class="balaton-page__cta-secondary">Back to experiences</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="balaton-page__hero-media">
          <Image src={heroImage} alt="Clear Lake Balaton shoreline in summer light" width={1400} loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="balaton-page__support">
        <article class="balaton-page__support-card">
          <span class="balaton-page__eyebrow">Rhythm</span>
          <h2>Start with the lake mood, then pick the stop</h2>
          <p>
            Some days call for a relaxed family beach. Others are better with a waterside walk,
            dinner in Badacsony or a quieter afternoon around Szigliget and Ábrahámhegy.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="balaton-page__support-card">
          <Image src={supportImage} alt="Witness hill panorama near Lake Balaton programs" width={1000} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="balaton-page__accordions" aria-label="Lake Balaton details">
        <details class="balaton-accordion" open>
          <summary>Nearby beaches and Lake Balaton stops</summary>
          <div class="balaton-accordion__content">
            <p>
              The area gives you several good lake directions, depending on whether you want a
              family beach day, a classic Balaton atmosphere or an evening walk by the water.
            </p>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>Szigliget beach</h3>
              <p>
                A good choice for a family beach day, swimming and a classic summer program. Its
                greener, comfortable setup makes it easy to like.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>Ábrahámhegy beach</h3>
              <p>
                A calmer, family-friendly Lake Balaton beach mood. It works especially well for a
                simple day by the water with children.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>Badacsony and Badacsonytomaj beaches</h3>
              <p>
                Choose this direction if you want to combine swimming with wine terraces, dinner or
                an evening walk. Badacsony brings piers, restaurants and a livelier summer feel.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>Badacsonylábdihegy and the Herczeg Ferenc beach</h3>
              <p>
                This can be a useful starting point when you want to connect beach time with an easy
                water program such as kayaking, canoeing or SUP in season.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="balaton-accordion">
          <summary>Kayak, canoe, SUP and light water programs</summary>
          <div class="balaton-accordion__content">
            <p>
              Lake Balaton is not only for swimming. In season, kayak, canoe, SUP and some boat
              programs may be available around the area, depending on weather and local providers.
            </p>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>Kayak and canoe around Badacsonylábdihegy</h3>
              <p>
                From the water, the view of Badacsony, Szigliget, Szent György Hill and the witness
                hills becomes part of the experience.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>SUP in calm weather</h3>
              <p>
                On still, safe days, SUP can be a light way to spend time on the water without
                turning the day into a serious sports program.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>Boat programs</h3>
              <p>
                Treat these as seasonal, provider-dependent options that are worth checking in
                advance.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="balaton-accordion__note">
              Water programs depend on season, weather and provider conditions. Always check
              current availability, prices and rental rules before setting off.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="balaton-accordion">
          <summary>Which lake program should you choose?</summary>
          <div class="balaton-accordion__content">
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>For a family beach day</h3>
              <p>Szigliget or Ábrahámhegy are comfortable, family-friendly directions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>For dinner, wine or an evening walk</h3>
              <p>Badacsony is the strongest choice when you want more life by the lake.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="balaton-stop">
              <h3>For kayak, canoe or SUP</h3>
              <p>
                Badacsonylábdihegy is a practical starting point where beach time and water programs
                can connect well.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .balaton-page {
    padding: 124px 0 88px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(109, 152, 177, 0.18), transparent 34%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fcfbf7 0%, #eff4f5 100%);
  }

  .balaton-page__inner,
  .balaton-page__hero-copy,
  .balaton-page__support-card,
  .balaton-page__accordions,
  .balaton-accordion__content,
  .balaton-stop {
    display: grid;
  }

  .balaton-page__inner {
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .balaton-page__eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #7a5b22;
    font-size: var(--dnd-text-2xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .balaton-page__hero,
  .balaton-page__support {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, 0.9fr);
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .balaton-page__support {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.82fr) minmax(0, 1.18fr);
  }

  .balaton-page__hero-copy,
  .balaton-page__support-card {
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 34px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(88, 63, 38, 0.12);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.84);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }

  .balaton-page h1,
  .balaton-page__support-card h2,
  .balaton-stop h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #261d16;
    font-family: var(--dnd-font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .balaton-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.2vw, 4.2rem);
    max-width: 11ch;
  }

  .balaton-page__hero-copy p,
  .balaton-page__support-card p,
  .balaton-accordion__content p,
  .balaton-accordion__content li {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(43, 32, 22, 0.84);
    font-size: var(--dnd-text-body);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .balaton-page__hero-highlights {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .balaton-page__hero-media,
  .balaton-page__support-card {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(43, 28, 14, 0.12);
  }

  .balaton-page__hero-media :global(picture),
  .balaton-page__hero-media :global(img),
  .balaton-page__support-card :global(picture),
  .balaton-page__support-card :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .balaton-page__hero-media :global(img),
  .balaton-page__support-card :global(img) {
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .balaton-page__hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .balaton-page__cta-primary,
  .balaton-page__cta-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(65, 47, 30, 0.4);
    color: #2b2016;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background 0.18s ease,
      border-color 0.18s ease,
      color 0.18s ease,
      transform 0.18s ease,
      box-shadow 0.18s ease;
  }

  .balaton-page__cta-primary {
    background: #2b2016;
    border-color: #2b2016;
    color: #fdfbf7;
  }

  .balaton-page__cta-primary:hover,
  .balaton-page__cta-primary:focus-visible,
  .balaton-page__cta-secondary:hover,
  .balaton-page__cta-secondary:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(43, 32, 22, 0.14);
  }

  .balaton-page__accordions {
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .balaton-accordion {
    border: 1px solid rgba(88, 63, 38, 0.12);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.9);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .balaton-accordion summary {
    position: relative;
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 22px 68px 22px 26px;
    color: #261d16;
    font-family: var(--dnd-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .balaton-accordion summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .balaton-accordion summary::after {
    content: "+";
    position: absolute;
    right: 24px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(88, 63, 38, 0.14);
    color: #6a4b2d;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .balaton-accordion[open] summary::after {
    content: "-";
  }

  .balaton-accordion__content {
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 0 26px 26px;
  }

  .balaton-stop {
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 20px 20px 22px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
    border: 1px solid rgba(88, 63, 38, 0.08);
  }

  .balaton-stop h3 {
    font-size: var(--dnd-text-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .balaton-accordion__note {
    color: rgba(43, 32, 22, 0.7) !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .balaton-page__hero,
    .balaton-page__support {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .balaton-page {
      padding: 108px 0 72px;
    }

    .balaton-page__inner {
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .balaton-page__hero-copy,
    .balaton-page__support-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .balaton-page__hero-media,
    .balaton-page__support-card,
    .balaton-accordion {
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .balaton-accordion summary,
    .balaton-accordion__content {
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    }

    .balaton-accordion summary {
      padding-top: 18px;
      padding-bottom: 18px;
      padding-right: 58px;
    }

    .balaton-accordion summary::after {
      right: 18px;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
    }

    .balaton-stop {
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
